,0.01,0.003,0.002,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.001,0.003],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"With all the skeletons and pirate crew scum facing off against you, your chances of survival are non-existent unless you can get them on your side. Unfortunately, you don’t speak undead…but, you are fluent in scum.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.384,"end":14.816,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"large":{"start":0.384,"end":14.816,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You toss a pouch of coins in front of the pirates, spilling its contents of gold and silver all over the street. The human pirates stop in their tracks and all stare. They look at each other, then, it’s a free for all.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":15.232,"end":26.46,"frac":0.977,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":43},"large":{"start":15.232,"end":26.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":43},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"With the human crew members dropping their ends of the sails, the skeletons get crushed under the weight. Three get pinned underneath the mizzen sail, while another’s skull gets knocked off the rest of its body, sending it rolling down the street.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":27.136,"end":38.688,"frac":0.976,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":42},"large":{"start":27.136,"end":38.68,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":42,"words":42},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"You take one final picture of the chaos for your pirate coat of arms. Nothing says ‘don’t mess with me’ like a treasure fight.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":39.008,"end":46.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"large":{"start":39.008,"end":46.592,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":24,"words":24},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"⚠️ Don't forget, download each photo right after you take it, or risk losing that masterpiece to the digital deep.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":19},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92de35624b_crest_v2.png"}